about:
  title: "About us"
  accommodation:
    text: "We offer accommodation in double rooms and also a four-bed apartment. Each room has a private bathroom with a shower or bathtub and a toilet."
  restaurant:
    text: "We warmly invite you to visit our restaurant in the style of a hunting lodge. We prepare game specialties and also offer traditional Czech cuisine."
  kladska:
    title: "What is Kladská?"
    text: "It’s a paradise for nature lovers and hikers. Tourist trails lead here from Lázně Kynžvart and Mariánské Lázně. Right from the restaurant starts the popular Kladská educational trail. Many visitors also come here for game hunting."

