history:
  title: "History"
  subtitle: "It is a family restaurant of the Koles family, which we opened on 1 Feb 2019."
  paragraph1: "The U Tetřeva restaurant stands on the site of an older inn from 1869, whose original form has not been preserved. In 1877, after the completion of the neighboring hunting chateau, a new inn was built according to a design by architect Johann Meyer from Lucerne, probably by the company Parquet- & Chalet-Fabrik Interlaken from Switzerland. Initially the inn was little visited due to its remote location, as evidenced by frequent changes of tenants. Only from the 1880s, when a road from Mariánské Lázně was built here, did it become a popular stop for spa guests. The inn originally bore the name Gasthaus Glatzen, in 1881 it was known as Zum Kaiserwald, and since 1884 it has borne the name U Tetřeva to this day."
  family:
    title: "Family restaurant & guesthouse"
